% asdg
# synth_nohf.ped -- control for synth_hf.ped. Identical except animal 5's
# unknown dam is filled in with founder 2 (no half-founder).
#
# The `g` column matches synth_hf.ped so both files load on the same terms.
# The pair differs in one parental field only.
1 0 0 1
2 0 0 1
3 0 0 1
4 1 2 2
5 3 2 2
6 4 5 3
7 4 5 3
